> build-house-style · deepseek-v4.1-flash:1017-cloud
Implemented screenshot capture.

- `internal/docker/screenshot.go`: creates a throwaway `zenika/alpine-chrome:with-puppeteer` container, captures a full-page PNG of the app URL, and stores it in the per-app cache directory.
- Routes the browser to the proxy via `ExtraHosts` plus Chrome resolver rules, so custom proxy ports and `.localhost` hosts work.
- Records capture success/failure in `AppState.LastScreenshot` and refreshes it after every deploy/update without failing the deploy.

Verification: `make test` passes; `make lint` reports `0 issues`.
